        "original_id": "a59445d0-5766-51a0-9a69-29afc30068aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Min-ho, Jun Ji-hyun, Hong Jin-kyung\n- Films and TV series: Gangnam Blues, Bounty Hunters, The Legend of the Blue Sea, My Love from the Star, Off to School\n- Places: Seoul, Gangnam district\n- Topics: South Korean television, Chinese-produced film, 1970s real estate development\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Hong Jin-kyung featured in the television series My Love from the Star.\n- In 2014, Hong Jin-kyung starred in the variety show Off to School.\n- In 2015, Lee Min-ho starred in his first leading film role in Gangnam Blues.\n- Gangnam Blues is set in the 1970s in Seoul's Gangnam district during real estate development, socio-political turmoil, and terrorism.\n- In 2016, Lee Min-ho starred in his first China-produced film, Bounty Hunters.\n- In 2016, Hong Jin-kyung featured in the television series The Legend of the Blue Sea.\n- The Legend of the Blue Sea is a 2016–2017 South Korean television series starring Jun Ji-hyun and Lee Min-ho.",
